This is a useful tool in programming pauses:

function(ask) {
   if (ask & interactive() & sink.number()==0) readline("\nType 
<Return>\t to continue : ")
}

It guards against batch use and sink-ing:

for (ii in 1:5) {
     cat(ii,"\n")
     waitReturn(ii %% 2 == 1)
   }

sink("blafile")
for (ii in 1:5) {
     cat(ii,"\n")
     waitReturn(ii %% 2 == 1)
   }
sink()
#look at file "blafile"

